{
  "schema": "gs-scenario/1",
  "id": "nostr-clock-five-minutes-off-at-the-epoch-change",
  "description": "The parent's clock is five minutes ahead and the daily address changes two minutes into the run, so for a while the two devices use different days. Both listen to both days around the change, the pair meets, and the link recovers from a lost path before and after the change. Five minutes is under the ten minute limit of the clock hint.",
